  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn></msub></math>, each phosphorus undergo&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;hybridisation. It has one P-O-P linkage in it.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/fb6c96c4-dc22-42ec-b689-7f060433e42b.png\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 155px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>HPO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/0479229f-5531-4a56-baa7-09b2ed940eb7.png\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 236px;\" /></p><p>In&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>HPO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub></math>, each phosphorus undergo&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;hybridisation. It has three&nbsp;P-O-P linkages in it.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>10</mn></msub></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/2ce69697-6301-48d2-a97f-177cbca5c605.png\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 212px;\" /></p><p>In&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>10</mn></msub></math>, each phosphorus undergo&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;hybridisation. It has six&nbsp;P-O-P linkages in it.</p>",
